                    "content": "<p><strong>An SRIT graduate in Civil Engineering, after three to four years of graduation will:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: #f67437;\"><strong>PEO 1: </strong></span><span style=\"color: #f67437;\"><strong> </strong></span>Become successful professional in Government agencies/companies or become an entrepreneur.</p><p><span style=\"color: #f67437;\"><strong>PEO 2:  </strong></span>Become responsible Civil Engineer with good leadership qualities to respond and contribute to the benefit of society at large.</p><p><span style=\"color: #f67437;\"><strong>PEO 3:  </strong></span>Engage in lifelong learning with good computational skills and work with multi-disciplinary approach and team spirit.</p>"
